<title>USA: Yonkers, N.Y., $50 mln deal ylds 5.45 pct in 2010.</title>
<headline>Yonkers, N.Y., $50 mln deal ylds 5.45 pct in 2010.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
